      "id": "62bde61aad9e1d463dea5de680f30643d2f5d866f32d365b816fa2779ec433f9",
      "title": "🔥 A euforia progressista e o luto golpista",
      "url": "https://substack.com/redirect/a075a0cd-426f-4eea-aaa0-c26df1c25533",
