      "pageDescription": "#30DayMapChallenge Day 1 Points - German supermarkets in London. 🗺️🛒 \n\nLidl has almost double the number of shops than Aldi in London (source: OpenStreetMap). But UK wide it seems Aldi is ahead and together they hold ~19% of total market share in the UK groceries market (source: theGrocer). \n\nA bit of a late start this year, not sure how many maps I",
      "evidenceText": "#30daymapchallenge #python #dataviz #maps | Lisa Hornung Agree & Join LinkedIn By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy . Skip to main content Lisa Hornung’s Post Lisa Hornung 1w Report this post #30DayMapChallenge Day 1 Points - German supermarkets in London. 🗺️🛒 Lidl has almost double the number of shops than Aldi in London (source: OpenStreetMap). But UK wide it seems Aldi is ahead and together they hold ~19% of total market share in the UK groceries market (source: theGrocer). A bit of a late start this year, not sure how many maps I'll make. But always good to start with a classic. Map made in #python , code here: https://lnkd.in/ew7jvUFP #Dataviz #Maps 38 4 Comments Like Comment Share Copy LinkedIn Facebook X Simon Gallacher (MRSC) 1w Report this comment We lost our SW17 Aldi a wee while ago 😐 Like Reply 1 Reaction 2 Reactions Anne Snelson BSc DipM MBA 1w Report this comment Interesting that Aldi has so many more north of the river. Like Reply 1 Reaction 2 Reactions See more comments To view or add a comment, sign in 2,496 followers 112 Posts View Profile Follow Explore content categories Career Productivity Finance Soft Skills & Emotional Intelligence Project Management Education Technology Leadership Ecommerce User Experience Show more Show less Sign in to view more content Create your free account or sign in to continue your search Email or phone Password Show Forgot password? Sign in Sign in with Email or New to LinkedIn? Join now By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy .",
