      "evidenceText": "Instagram {\"require\":[[\"ScheduledServerJS\",\"handle\",null,[{\"__bbox\":{\"require\":[[\"PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWCarouselMedia_media$normalization.graphql\"],[\"PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWCarouselMedia.react\"],[\"emptyFunction\",\"thatReturns\",[\"RequireDeferredReference\"],[[{\"__dr\":\"PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWCarouselMedia_media$normalization.graphql\"},{\"__dr\":\"PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWCarouselMedia.react\"}]]],[\"RelayPrefetchedStreamCache\",\"next\",[],[\"adp_PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWPostRootContentQueryRelayPreloader_6afb57c115b522571534008\",{\"__bbox\":{\"complete\":true,\"result\":{\"data\":{\"xig_polaris_media\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4022393526226927123\",\"code\":\"DfSaZm9lj4T\",\"if_not_gated_logged_out\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"profile_pic_url\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.2885-19\\/276302167_508066144260224_375533703256475109_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=GFcJeBCAEA1eFc4BAOUFytfpKTYFbkULAAAB1501500j-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=669407&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0\\u00253D&_nc_ohc=7b76AP4eKhUQ7kNvwEYQpKZ&_nc_oc=AdrCzjef5X3voGcqyk7EUPDX0B-RVAV23X-pJ_NygpQoGR0dAHMWTZ_uOIFmd650OLA&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUCFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQS9fyelolkSFrNOzlwDB7md_rjxj8U2H3Ok2jiGKq_w0w&oe=6B011A82\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"polaris_ordered_timeline_connection\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"pk\":\"4029596056216325361\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on November 13, 2026. May be a graphic of television, map, screen, poster and text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"Americans are going to bed earlier than they used to \\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f\\ud83d\\udd65\\n\\nIn 2025, 47\\u0025 of Americans were asleep from 10-11pm, up from just 40\\u0025 between 2011-2015 \\ud83d\\udca4\\ud83d\\udcc8. The tradeoff has mainly been watching less late-night TV (and a little less socializing) \\ud83d\\udcfa\\ud83d\\udcc9\\n\\nThe other significant change is our relationship with work. As remote and hybrid work have emerged, Americans are working a little less during the day and doing a little more cooking & cleaning, household chores, and other leisure activities\\n\\nBetween YouTube, social media, and sports, I find it hard to put down my phone \\/ laptop and go to sleep early, so this data surprises me. What about you?\\n\\nData source: American Time Use Survey from the U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics\\n\\nChart Inspiration: Home Economics Substack\"},\"code\":\"DfsAENvFszx\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/902714933_18077217965749790_1657521494787281664_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=_GteH_DVTwQQ7kNvwHwIKDY&_nc_oc=AdoekptUpzzQnJbkgJbJKoMw4scWXH9u3TqMzYcrN9pMkeAfELSUm02EEqXJEsWmY90&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQREfdUIIrEOlLIYtv0qw4SxJG4JHw6y-6ITYThGWGKq_w&oe=6B011DAD\",\"media_type\":1,\"product_type\":\"feed\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"id\":\"POLARIS_4029596056216325361\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"pk\":\"4027456850036768595\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on November 10, 2026. May be an image of basketball and text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"The NBA's Western Conference has had a winning record versus the Eastern Conference in 24 of the past 27 seasons! \\n\\nSo far in 2026-27, the West is 26-6 versus the East\\n\\nWith Wemby, SGA, Ant, and Flagg in the West, the scales may remain tipped for the foreseeable future\\n\\nIt wasn't always this way. In the 60s and the 80s, the East dominated\\n\\nThe late 70s and the Michael Jordan era in the 90s were the only two periods of NBA history during which the conferences were relatively balanced\\n\\nIs the recent trend just random, or is there some reason why the West is simply better these days? \\n\\n#dataviz #nba #nbastats\"},\"code\":\"DfkZqqup79T\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/898800587_18076745351749790_22807352331674571_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=wa6Dmf0lIjcQ7kNvwF7TyQK&_nc_oc=AdrN_-MQqWWPfNlnFR0KkNY0bzyn-t4aTgR0HTgdWTL76wU0FmUAsHfXeCvSJGqaCvE&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQQy3rECpjRrTMdzQZJ-Pm-vRkIHGh8OynRaO-4A-_m6yg&oe=6B01281D\",\"media_type\":1,\"product_type\":\"feed\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"id\":\"POLARIS_4027456850036768595\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"pk\":\"4026767060051040008\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on November 09, 2026. May be a graphic of poster and text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"Who is NBA's best isolation scorer over the past three seasons?\\n\\nUnsurprisingly, James Harden and Shai Gilgeous-Alexander iso more than anyone else in the league. Luka Doncic is also an extremely efficient, high-volume isolation scorer \\ud83d\\udd25\\n\\nWith 99 points on 88 isos, Ty Jerome is actually the most efficient player with at least a 75-possession sample size. Payton Pritchard is also up there\\n\\nJokic, Haliburton, and Steph iso less than most other super players, despite being efficient\\n\\nA bunch of star players are below-average iso efficiency \\ud83e\\udd76: Wemby, Sengun, Maxey, Paolo, Randle, KAT, LaMelo, Franz, etc. \\n\\nWhat jumps out to you?\\n\\n#dataviz #nba #nbastats #harden #sga #luka\"},\"code\":\"Dfh805vlhcI\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/897763976_18076596608749790_2621341950126907419_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=kSpVIFs-AAkQ7kNvwHRmZrK&_nc_oc=Adpru2KT7RPUeqIShOwCetigMtCuF5X2kVf5i7NPm7Tr8EA2EOKG_jxsJZtE5yjNk08&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQQuKsbbvwEmF17PKyaw-UAYtVSUTA0n2Zs47Pb01mQ78A&oe=6B013825\",\"media_type\":1,\"product_type\":\"feed\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"id\":\"POLARIS_4026767060051040008\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4024505120440350644\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on November 06, 2026.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"Adam Hamilton will be the first Democratic senator from Kansas since 1939\\n\\nMississippi* and Texas will also flip \\ud83d\\udd04 for the first time since 1989 and 1993, respectively \\n\\nIn the House, Democrats \\ud83c\\udf0a had their best popular vote margin since 1976 and the biggest swing in modern history aside from 2010\\n\\n* Race has not been called, but leans Democrat\\n\\n#election #dataviz\"},\"code\":\"DfZ6hWUlne0\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-2.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/890333677_18076134425749790_74009622135210444_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=ufdW5XjSJDwQ7kNvwFhkjyz&_nc_oc=Adr3GgXcxgYmcajgRvzgj81pH-aRsQCq9_rP-HFC87NkTJCJTxpD1FQxn4_0MDtLTFo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQTdFSu9NX-sKZBXduuU6f6ow3368lpAnoniebCjr7lrRw&oe=6B01418E\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"carousel_media_count\":2,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4024505120440350644\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4022393526226927123\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on November 03, 2026. May be an image of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"1998 (Clinton) and 2002 (Bush) are the only two modern midterm elections in which the president's party gained seats in the House of Representatives\\n\\nSometimes the president's party gains seats in the Senate, but the average is still -3.6 seats per midterm election\\n\\nRepublicans currently have a 218-214 majority in the House and a 53-47 majority in the Senate\\n\\nIf you haven't voted yet, VOTE!\\n\\nWe'll see what happens...\\n\\n#dataviz #politics #midterms #electionday\"},\"code\":\"DfSaZm9lj4T\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-2.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/887193612_18075729323749790_3308218710176180723_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=0TAV1q2hkCMQ7kNvwEOSZoK&_nc_oc=Adrse-At0Re2iNJaupahiEc5pPE6ZYe2kcfUpw5vhZKdmdsBBerPa9ZKuWFkm6Bb-3A&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQTmeuv05KoU93E1LxJ6Kf1ea_mz987HAwfTEpWt2adbNQ&oe=6B012690\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"carousel_media_count\":2,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4022393526226927123\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4021842334048490041\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on November 02, 2026. May be an image of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"Alexander Zverev is the new ATP No. 1\\n\\nHe is only the third men's tennis player to become No. 1 since 2004 outside of the Big 3 (Roger Federer, Rafael Nadal, Novak Djokovic) and the new Big 2 (Jannik Sinner, Carlos Alcaraz), joining Andy Murray and Daniil Medvedev\\n\\nIs Zverev the least impressive No. 1 this century? \\n\\n\\u2022 He has just three top 10 wins this season\\n\\u2022 His 25\\u0025 record against the top 10 is bested by 25 other players with at least six such matches played\\n\\u2022 He even has a losing record (9-12) against top 20 players! \\n\\u2022 He took advantage of weak draws to win the French Open and US Open, in which he faced only one top 20 opponent at each\\n\\u2022 Those are his only two tournament wins since April 2025\\n\\n#dataviz #tennis #atp #zverev #sinner #alcaraz #djokovic #federer #nadal\"},\"code\":\"DfQdEtPlpI5\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/883626871_18075626987749790_2660907022646092717_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=_tUXPn_z5dYQ7kNvwHhMbWP&_nc_oc=AdrhptzHbXtNf25CwZP-0O1oPvfJ8nr-17dWeJEYNYeBw3PxjDKWus7sE_-LOCTCt4o&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQRDXXXXTt0meqBu8EWpfC1zg10zdKEhlWch5wtFEy0V2w&oe=6B012A09\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"carousel_media_count\":3,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4021842334048490041\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4020895798703585112\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on November 01, 2026. May be an image of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"New York City Marathon demographics data:\\n\\n\\u2022 More men run than women in all age brackets except 18-24 and 25-29\\n\\n\\u2022 The largest age bracket is 25-29 by far\\n\\n\\u2022 In 1978, runners aged 50+ made up just 6\\u0025 of all participants... last year, they accounted for 23\\u0025\\n\\n\\u2022 The number of runners in their teens and 20s has nearly doubled in the past decade\\n\\n\\u2022 The number of runners in their 40s has actually declined in the past decade\\n\\n\\u2022 About 40\\u0025 of finishers are from outside the USA, led by Italy\\n\\nDid you know? NYC Marathon runners spend nearly half of the race in just one borough (Brooklyn)! Also, the marathon covers more distance over water than it does in the Bronx borough\\n\\n#dataviz #marathon #nycmarathon #runners #running\"},\"code\":\"DfNF2zglndY\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/883626876_18075428837749790_5425143203374585298_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=hGrR-3aVKWAQ7kNvwHS3o_E&_nc_oc=AdosLguJv2PAuvEYJialQyJ1GaKpVCkEzzrFPsmRYpoXkj23632XLUIKrCvbeYN4ApE&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQTrs_3eG0Le7C9asMCv-ShrmYZxso_UnVWbdxV1vyPyGg&oe=6B013818\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"carousel_media_count\":6,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4020895798703585112\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4019484929293723523\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on October 30, 2026. May be an image of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"As part of a competition with a few friends, I attempted the very dumb challenge of trying to write the names of 3,000 real people in one sitting\\n\\nIt took 7 hours, but I did it \\n\\nAnd then, of course, I had to make some data viz out of it \\ud83d\\udcca\\n\\nFull list of 3,000 linked in bio\"},\"code\":\"DfIFD8-lqeD\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/873874128_18075108785749790_8275789163783569336_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=5VfdW6VLRvgQ7kNvwGmlKbe&_nc_oc=Adoj2_GNys7-GloRUoNq9CJF28T9m0FcTOJ9Ct--dXp_qoh0GfV5_njY1zkTuVCJPws&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQTbNff8wZE6uThyTCoTZiujfS_N3CojVMPXsiNWRL45CQ&oe=6B01205E\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"carousel_media_count\":5,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4019484929293723523\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4018690419408155745\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on October 29, 2026. May be an image of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"The Milwaukee Brewers just won the 2026 World Series, but MLB players and owners face a grueling labor fight ahead\\n\\nMLB\\u2019s collective bargaining agreement expires on Dec. 1 and there is expected to be a lockout that could cancel games in 2027. The league seeks significant reforms to the sport's business, most notably a salary floor and salary cap, which the players strongly oppose\\n\\n12 teams' payrolls were under the proposed floor of $171.2 million this past season (including the Brewers), with the Miami Marlins bringing up the rear at $84 million\\n\\n9 teams' payrolls were above the proposed cap of $245.3 million, with the Los Angeles Dodgers way out in front at $433 million\\n\\nThe majority of MLB teams would need to change their spending habits \\n\\nThe owners believe enormous payroll disparities have eroded the competitive balance and financial sustainability of baseball. Outside of the 2026 Brewers, spending on players has strongly correlated with postseason success in MLB this century (\\u27a1\\ufe0f swipe to slides 2 and 3)\\n\\nA salary cap would also provide owners with cost certainty on their biggest expense. That protects against any year-to-year revenue uncertainty, and potentially drives franchise valuation growth, which has lagged other sports leagues recently (\\u27a1\\ufe0f swipe to slide 4)\\n\\nPlayers, meanwhile, oppose any changes that limit their earning potential. Players' wages relative to team revenues have declined since the early 2000s (\\u27a1\\ufe0f swipe to slide 5), and the union sees a salary cap as simply another way for owners to avoid paying them what they deserve\\n\\n#dataviz #mlb #sportsbiz #ladodgers #dodgers #milwaukeebrewers #brewers\"},\"code\":\"DfFQaT_FrRh\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/876310524_18074937989749790_4538853026658820298_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=vVTxGrdzD0QQ7kNvwExaxDh&_nc_oc=Ado_-qNzT-arOHR5vxLx_FbQyVMl-DEZ-BrXxnXSxBa7oVeC-wESbrli7ACFTLsUvqY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQQi29MtSX0CqCdjplEbopmO2oth6q0sQHFaOIjAyG3_8A&oe=6B013C3A\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"carousel_media_count\":5,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4018690419408155745\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4018021351558674827\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on October 28, 2026.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"Unlikely NBA Finals teams have been more common in the 2020s\\n\\nPrior to this decade, only three teams outside the top 10 in preseason title odds had ever made the Finals. This decade, 6 out of 7 NBA Finals have featured one such team ('20 Heat, '21 Suns, '22 Celtics, '24 Mavs, '25 Pacers, and '26 Spurs)\\n\\nSome interesting teams outside the top 10 for 2026-27: Heat, Pacers, Rockets, Lakers, Blazers\\n\\nNBA champions, however, still come from the small cohort of favorites. No team outside the top 10 in preseason odds has ever won the title \\n\\n#nba #dataviz #nyknicks #spurs\"},\"code\":\"DfC4SF_lvmL\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/871062982_18074761928749790_5288857893706637253_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=myzpp7l2oLYQ7kNvwEr9F6N&_nc_oc=Adq7qj5PYHmL6qtLgDv9eLnnQNH4YJdJ3REAA_oBQLJaOfICNhcXWy5-lMjQw3Q9cs4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=BQggvO341j7lBttpj3bZHw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQSqmqJeAHFDwFoCv9yOwqmtsNjfyKTwj4chWHiSg0r8Ew&oe=6B01141D\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"52403749789\",\"username\":\"datakabas\",\"id\":\"17841452493680468\"},\"carousel_media_count\":2,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4018021351558674827\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"pk\":\"4012906822260628005\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by Lev Akabas, Data Visualization on October 21, 2026. May be a graphic of football, volleyball, basketball, poster, magazine, ball, backboard, sports equipment, basketball court and text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"How long have NBA players been with their teams? \\n\\nThis is Steph Curry's 18th season with the Golden State Warriors. On the other hand, we have the Los Angeles Clippers, with 0 players remaining from before the 2023-24 season!\\n\\nThe Los Angeles Lakers have 9 new players this season. The Orlando Magic only have 1\\n\\nLongest-tenured NBA players:\\n\\n2009 - Steph Curry - GSW\\",
